        "confidence": "mid",
        "defect": "parseRefreshTokenResponse writes the literal string \"refresh_token\" over a missing refresh token, which corrupts the stored credential. Separately, the minimumTokenResponseSchema computed keys collapse to \"[object Object]\", so zod strips the expiry and every other field except access_token.",
