        "needsUnifiedComment": false,
        "confidence": "high",
        "defect": "In sync mode, refreshOAuthTokens returns a raw fetch Response, but callers (such as Google's res?.data) expect a parsed token object, so token refresh breaks.",
        "rationale": "All three report the same shape mismatch, either at the helper or at the Google call site. Parsing the response inside the helper fixes all of them."
